      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-148554",
      ":question/problem": "Anna wishes to find the value of $21 \\cdot 17$. She starts by writing both factors in expanded form.\n\n$21 = 20 + 1, 17 = 10 + 7$\n\nThen, she proceeds as follows:\n\n$20 \\cdot 10|= 000; 20 \\cdot 7|= 000; 1 \\cdot 10|= 10; 1 \\cdot 7|= 10$\n\nFind the missing numbers, and use your answers to find the value of $21 \\cdot 17$."
