      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-148919",
      ":question/problem": "Matthew wishes to find the value of $39 \\cdot 18$. He starts by writing both factors in expanded form.\n\n$39 = 30 + 9, 18 = 10 + 8$\n\nThen, he proceeds as follows:\n\n$30 \\cdot 10|= 000; 30 \\cdot 8|= 000; 9 \\cdot 10|= 10; 9 \\cdot 8|= 10$\n\nFind the missing numbers, and use your answers to find the value of $39 \\cdot 18$."
